        <main id="cv-content">
            <section id="summary" class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp cv-section">
                <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
                <p>Passionate and experienced Senior Software Engineer with over 8 years in the industry. Skilled in backend development, particularly with Node.js and AWS. Proven ability to lead projects, manage teams, and deliver high-quality software solutions on time. Known for strong problem-solving skills, innovation, and the ability to work independently and collaboratively within a team.</p>
                <p>Contact me at: <a href="mailto:johnpietrar@gmail.com">johnpietrar@gmail.com</a></p>
            </section>
            <section id="experience" class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp cv-section">
                <h2>Professional Experience</h2>
                <div class="experience current-role">
                    <div class="role-header">
                        <h3>Mindera (Node.js/AWS/NoSQL)</h3>
                        <span class="tech-lead-badge">TECHNICAL LEAD</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>Technical Lead / Senior Software Engineer (Apr 2022 - Present)</p>
                    <p class="client-highlight">Client: LEGO Group - UK</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li class="achievement-highlight">Architected and developed the complete infrastructure and backend for LEGO Magazine from the ground up</li>
                        <li class="achievement-highlight">Implemented comprehensive testing suite including unit, integration, and E2E tests ensuring 95%+ code coverage</li>
                        <li class="achievement-highlight">Created custom admin tool for magazine content management, streamlining editorial workflows</li>
                        <li class="achievement-highlight">Built automated data pipeline to Databricks for analytics and business intelligence</li>
                        <li class="achievement-highlight">Designed and implemented automated GDPR compliance system for data privacy requirements</li>
                        <li>Leading technical decisions and mentoring team members on best practices</li>
                        <li>Conducting code reviews and facilitating the interview process for new hires</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="client-highlight">Previous Client: Dunelm - UK's largest homewares retailer</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Built and maintained scalable e-commerce solutions using AWS and Node.js</li>
                        <li>Optimized backend services handling millions of customer transactions</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="experience">
                    <h3>3Pillar Global (Node.js/AWS/NoSQL)</h3>
                    <p>Software Engineer (Aug 2019 - Apr 2022)</p>
                    <p class="client-highlight">Clients: Fortune 500 Companies</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Developed enterprise-grade web applications for Fortune 500 clients using AWS and Node.js</li>
                        <li>Participated in the full software development lifecycle for high-stakes projects</li>
                        <li>Implemented microservices architecture enhancing scalability for millions of users</li>
                        <li>Delivered innovative solutions meeting strict enterprise security and compliance standards</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="experience">
                    <h3>Webamboos (Node.js/AWS/NoSQL)</h3>
                    <p>Software Development Specialist (Aug 2018 - Aug 2019)</p>
                    <p class="role-description">Jack-of-all-trades developer handling diverse project categories</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Tackled projects across every conceivable category - from e-commerce to IoT, fintech to content management</li>
                        <li>Rapidly adapted to new technologies and domains, delivering solutions across varied tech stacks</li>
                        <li>Specialized in developing server-side applications, APIs, and cloud integrations</li>
                        <li>Integrated AWS services to improve application performance and scalability</li>
                        <li>Optimized and enhanced existing codebases across multiple client projects</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="experience">
                    <h3>Flex (C#/SQL)</h3>
                    <p>Software Development Engineer (May 2016 - Aug 2018)</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Collaborated directly with production line engineers to improve manufacturing systems</li>
                        <li>Designed and developed software solutions optimizing factory floor operations</li>
                        <li>Implemented real-time communication systems between production line equipment</li>
                        <li>Enhanced system efficiency leading to measurable improvements in production output</li>
                        <li>Bridged the gap between software and hardware, translating engineering needs into code</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="education" class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp cv-section">
                <h2>Education</h2>
                <p>Politehnica University Timisoara - Bachelor's degree, Computer Science</p>
            </section>
            <section id="skills" class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp cv-section">
                <h2>Skills</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Programming Languages: Node.js, TypeScript, C#, Python</li>
                    <li>Cloud Services: Amazon Web Services (AWS)</li>
                    <li>Database Technologies: NoSQL, SQL</li>
                    <li>Development Practices: Microservices, Data Analysis, Optimization</li>
                    <li>Professional Skills: Communication, Team Leadership, Problem-Solving</li>
